Rustproofing spoiler:



































Become confused, then read a scroll of enchant weapon. (One that isn't cursed,
of course.)  Scrolls usually have strange effects when you are confused, and
the effect of this one is to rustproof your wielded weapon.  A rustproof sword
is also acid proof.  You can rustproof metal armor too, by getting confused and
read a uncursed scroll of enchant armor.  You should probably remove all other
armor to make sure the correct piece is rustproofed.
